    "message": "Implement synergy-12 List landing page redesign\n\nPixel-matched to the workout-tracker.html design from claude.ai/design.\nMakes the List tab the public landing page (renders for auth + unauth)\nand gives it an anatomical hero, scoreboard stats strip, filter pills,\nand a date-grouped timeline of workouts / cardio / soreness. Adds a\n12-segment cycle dial to the sidebar showing today's day in its accent.\n\n- New: utils/dayDesign.js (per-day accent + muscle slug + helpers)\n- New: components/CycleDial.jsx (12-segment SVG dial w/ today center)\n- Rewritten: components/ListTab.jsx (hero + stats + filters + feed)\n- index.css: Archivo font, design tokens, .anatomy/.display/.eyebrow\n- App.jsx: list is the default tab, '/' maps to list, sidebar hosts dial\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) \u003cnoreply@anthropic.com\u003e",
